      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-11T11:50:42.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹10.30 loss per share (vs ₹0.57 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹10.30 loss per share (further deteriorated from ₹0.57 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹10.8b (up 1.1% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹479.5m (loss widened ₹453.1m from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 89 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
